OL,3,ANo 10 insists RAF Fairford is safe
OL,4,Aafter US withdraws bombers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA No 10 spokesperson said he would not
OL,7,Fcomment on "foreign nations' military
OL,8,Foperations", but said the base was
OL,9,Fsafe, and pointed to US President
OL,10,FDonald Trump's comments last week,
OL,11,Fwhere he "praised our police, defence
OL,12,Fand security services" in relation to
OL,13,Fthe base.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
