OL,3,AFlydubai co-pilot planned to crash
OL,4,Aplane into Tel Aviv airport or
OL,5,Abuilding, reports say
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe co-pilot accused of trying to
OL,8,Fhijack a flydubai plane planned to
OL,9,Fcrash the aircraft into Tel Aviv's Ben
OL,10,FGurion airport or a tower block in the
OL,11,FIsraeli city, US and Israeli reports
OL,12,Fsuggest.
OL,14,FThe Omani national was a "lone wolf"
OL,15,Fextremist, according to the reports.
OL,17,FThe United Arab Emirates'
OL,18,Fattorney-general has said the co-pilot
OL,19,Fattempted to carry out a "terrorist
OL,20,Fact" on flight FZ1073 from Dubai to Tel
OL,21,FAviv last Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
