OL,3,ATeenager's hand blown off during
OL,4,Aconfrontation between France school
OL,5,Aprotesters and police
OL,6,
OL,7,F"The student's life is not in danger,"
OL,8,Fhe said, adding that the teenager was
OL,9,Ftransferred "very quickly" to a
OL,10,Fhospital in nearby.
OL,12,FAround 500 schools were partially or
OL,13,Ftotally closed across the country on
OL,14,FMonday amid student protests over the
OL,15,Fcondition of school buildings and
OL,16,Fstaffing which have led to clashes with
OL,17,Fpolice in recent days.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
